'''Falcon''' (formerly known as '''Bird: Falcon''') was an {{Uncommon}} [[Beast]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costed {{Money|300,000}} or {{Robux|650}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

The Falcon Fruit allowed the user to transform into a human-hybrid {{w|Falcon}}, allowing them to fly and dash to attack foes.

Falcon was generally known as one of the worst fruits in the game, as it only had three attack moves, all of which dealt medium damage and lacked [[AoE]]. Although it could be useful in PvP if used properly, it was not worth the risk of using it as a main fruit.

